## 4. `VisualStreamEvent` types

Defined in `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_visual_stream/lib/src/visual_stream_event.dart`.

**Enum `VisualStreamStatus`:**

```1:7:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_visual_stream/lib/src/visual_stream_event.dart
enum VisualStreamStatus {
  idle,
  connecting,
  previewing,
  disconnected,
  error,
}
```

**Named constructors on `VisualStreamEvent`:** `idle`, `connecting`, `previewing`, `disconnected`, `error` (with optional `message` / `errorCode`).

**Not present:** `playing`, `paused`, `buffering`. The closest to “playing” is **`previewing`**, emitted when `MediaKitVisualStream` sees `_player.stream.playing == true`:

```45:49:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/core/core_visual_stream/lib/src/media_kit_visual_stream.dart
    _playingSub ??= _player.stream.playing.listen((playing) {
      if (playing) {
        debugPrint('[VisualStream][MediaKit] previewing');
        _events.add(const VisualStreamEvent.previewing());
      }
    });
```

