## 5. `ObjectRecognitionSseParser` — stateful class or pure/static?

It is an **instantiable class with instance methods**, not a static-only utility.

```5:6:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_glasses_object_recognition/lib/src/service/object_recognition_sse_parser.dart
class ObjectRecognitionSseParser {
  const ObjectRecognitionSseParser();
```

- `parse()` is an instance `async*` method
- `_parseJson()` and `_toDelta()` are private instance methods
- No mutable fields — effectively stateless per parse, but held as an instance on the service:

```56:59:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_glasses_object_recognition/lib/src/service/object_recognition_service.dart
    ObjectRecognitionSseParser? parser,
  }) : _httpClient = httpClient,
       _config = config,
       _parser = parser ?? const ObjectRecognitionSseParser();
```

