### Quick reference table

| Question | Answer |
|---|---|
| `captureFrame()` type | `Future<Uint8List>` (async) |
| Off UI thread? | No — no isolate/compute in codebase |
| `ask()` returns Stream? | Yes, `Stream<ObjectRecognitionDelta>` |
| SSE cancel via subscription? | Yes (`_answerSub`), but HTTP already completed |
| Refresh screenshot | Reuses image + `sessionId` |
| New screenshot | New capture/upload, reuses `sessionId` |
| Background/resume | No handling |
| Event statuses | `idle`, `connecting`, `previewing`, `disconnected`, `error` |
| Parser style | Const instance class, not static functions |
| Spec thread safety | Not documented |
